		(property "Description" "Trusted Platform Module TPM 2.0 (Infineon OPTIGA TPM SLB 9672, firmware FW16.24, field upgradable), SPI mode 0 up to 33MHz, VDD 1.65-1.95V or 3.0-3.6V, 35mA active / 120uA sleep, PG-UQFN-32 5x5mm, -40 to 85C. 100nF on each VDD pin plus 1uF bulk; RST# held low >= 80us after VDD is stable (cold reset); PIRQ# open drain, no internal pull-up; NC pins 6, 29, 30 must stay unconnected"
